@startuml kairos-view-kgroup-details-sequence
title View K-Group List and Detail

actor Pastor
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Pastor -> WebAdmin: Open K-Groups list
WebAdmin -> API: GET /kgroups?branchId=...
API -> DB: SELECT k-groups
DB --> API: List
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {kgroups}

Pastor -> WebAdmin: Click a K-Group
WebAdmin -> API: GET /kgroups/{id}
API -> DB: SELECT k-group + members + meetings + notes
DB --> API: Detail
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {detail}

WebAdmin --> Pastor: Show K-Group Detail

@enduml
